.TH RATASH-PROXY-LIST 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.3" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-proxy\-list \- List the Nodes exposed by one Proxy Group
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash proxy list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIGROUP\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the Nodes exposed by one Proxy Group
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIGROUP\fR>
Opaque Proxy Group ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
